nto the local deny-first permission contract.\n78-\n79-The local model should remain the governance wrapper around upstream behavior, not a hidden replacement.\n--\n81-### `OC-002`\n82-\n83:Use upstream OpenClaw workflow or scheduler entrypoints for:\n84-\n85-- ingest\n--\n92-### `OC-003`\n93-\n94:Normalize upstream OpenClaw outputs into:\n95-\n96-- `StrategySpec`\n--\n103-The first integration smoke test should prove:\n104-\n105:1. a pinned upstream OpenClaw runtime can start\n106-2. one minimal approved workflow can be invoked\n107-3. that workflow can emit a governed handoff payload\n--\n111-Suggested flow:", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01XNWhmkk5PgkpGSjbenoo13"}, "ts_local": "2026-04-03T15:08:47Z"}
