{"ts": "2026-04-04T06:04:48Z", "agent": "Orchestrator", "type": "permission_hook", "provider": "claude", "message": "PostToolUse: Edit", "hook_event": "PostToolUse", "hook_payload": {"session_id": "cd416913-4d27-403a-a8e2-205266a59a42", "transcript_path": "/home/ajoe734/.claude/projects/-home-ajoe734-code-Lean/cd416913-4d27-403a-a8e2-205266a59a42.jsonl", "cwd": "/home/ajoe734/code/Lean", "permission_mode": "acceptEdits", "hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "tool_name": "Edit", "tool_input": {"file_path": "/home/ajoe734/code/Lean/ai-status.json", "old_string": "  \"objective\": \"Align the repo to the governed OpenClaw target architecture where OpenClaw orchestrates workflows, the evolution plane learns through feedback and registry gates, and LEAN executes only approved artifacts.\",", "new_string": "  \"objective\": \"Align the repo to the governed Pantheon target architecture where Pantheon orchestrates workflows, the evolution plane learns through feedback and registry gates, and LEAN executes only approved artifacts.\",", "replace_all": false}, "tool_response": {"filePath": "/home/ajoe734/code/Lean/ai-status.json", "oldString": "  \"objective\": \"Align the repo to the governed OpenClaw target architecture where OpenClaw orchestrates workflows, the evolution plane learns through feedback and registry gates, and LEAN executes only approved artifacts.\",", "newString": "  \"objective\": \"Align the repo to the governed Pantheon target architecture where Pantheon orchestrates workflows, the evolution plane learns through feedback and registry gates, and LEAN executes only approved artifacts.\",", "originalFile": "{\n  \"project\": \"pantheon\",\n  \"sprint\": \"2026-04-01-architecture-alignment\",\n  \"objective\": \"Align the repo to the governed OpenClaw target architecture where OpenClaw orchestrates workflows, the evolution plane learns through feedback and registry gates, and LEAN executes only approved artifacts.\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-04-02T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"canonical_files\": [\n    \"AI_COLLABORATION_GUIDE.md\",\n    \"current-work.md\",\n    \"ai-status.json\",\n    \"ai-activity-log.jsonl\",\n    \"TARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md\",\n    \"ROADMAP.md\"\n  ],\n  \"agents\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Claude\",\n      \"capability_lane\": [\n        \"execution\",\n        \"control-plane\",\n        \"governance-review\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"reviewing\",\n      \"current_task_ids\": [\n        \"P3-001\",\n        \"AUD-CLAUDE-001\"\n      ],\n      \"branch\": \"feat/claude-execution-control\",\n      \"next\": \"Audit complete. Full findings at audits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md. Summary: (1) EX-001 must be reset to in_progress/blocked — artifact-loader/ does not exist despite done status. (2) P3-001 valid design but needs LEAN integration bridge: pin LEAN dep, fix _resolve_symbol() to use Symbol.Create(), add smoke test. (3) P4-001 valid; persona agent is local stub — upstream OpenClaw integration decision must be formally documented. (4) OC-001 and OC-003 valid as local contracts; upstream adapter work blocked on OpenClaw source selection. Recommended follow-up: 6 new tasks or corrections listed in §Required Follow-up.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T13:51:16Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"capability_lane\": [\n        \"gcp\",\n        \"ci-cd\",\n        \"runtime-packaging\",\n        \"worker-ops\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"working\",\n      \"current_task_ids\": [\n        \"OC-002\",\n        \"REG-002\",\n        \"LP-003\"\n      ],\n      \"branch\": \"feat/gemini-research-runtime\",\n      \"next\": \"REG-002 handed off for review; OC-002 and LP-003 adapters drafted. Next: defining smoke tests for adapters.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T18:00:00Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Codex\",\n      \"capability_lane\": [\n        \"integration\",\n        \"status-system\",\n        \"schema\",\n        \"acceptance\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"reviewing\",\n      \"current_task_ids\": [\n        \"REG-003\",\n        \"FB-001\",\n        \"LP-001\"\n      ],\n      \"branch\": \"feat/codex-collab-system\",\n      \"next\": \"Drafted REG-003 promoted artifact lineage contract, canonical schema, and compatibility alias at artifact_metadata_schema.json. Please review rollback strictness, loader-side sufficiency, and experiment-backend compatibility.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T13:50:25Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Grok\",\n      \"capability_lane\": [\n        \"research-ingest\",\n        \"external-search\",\n        \"spec-review\",\n        \"critique\"\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"working\",\n      \"current_task_ids\": [\n        \"AUD-GROK-002\"\n      ],\n      \"branch\": \"feat/grok-research-critique\",\n      \"next\": \"Started adapter spike for RS-001 upstream integration\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T14:28:20Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OPS-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Canonicalize collaboration rules\",\n      \"phase\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"AI_COLLABORATION_GUIDE.md\",\n        \"current-work.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"canonical rules defined\",\n        \"current-work reduced to sprint snapshot\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Keep guide stable while downstream work starts\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T04:20:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把協作規則收斂成單一真相，讓所有 LLM 都只看同一套規範，不再各自維護不同流程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OPS-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Build JSON status pipeline\",\n      \"phase\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"OPS-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"ai-status.json\",\n        \"ai-activity-log.jsonl\",\n        \"scripts/ai-status.sh\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"state updates through script\",\n        \"history append-only\",\n        \"current-work regenerated from JSON state\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Use script-driven updates only\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T04:24:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"建立 JSON 狀態與歷史紀錄機制，讓任務狀態、交接、阻塞都能被機器與人同步讀取。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OPS-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Build collaboration dashboard\",\n      \"phase\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"OPS-002\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"docs-site/index.html\",\n        \"docs-site/script.js\",\n        \"docs-site/style.css\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"dashboard renders workload\",\n        \"dashboard renders board, blockers, handoffs, recent activity\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Collect visual feedback and adjust layout if needed\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T04:28:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"建立協作 dashboard，把分工、進度、依賴與最近活動視覺化，方便你隨時掌握全局。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define SignalStoreClient contract\",\n      \"phase\": \"Phase 1\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/signal-store/client.py\",\n        \"services/signal-store/README.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"interface documented\",\n        \"example payload added\",\n        \"consumer assumptions listed\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Interface locked and accepted by Gemini\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T16:10:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 SignalStoreClient 的最小穩定介面，讓 research、control plane 與 execution 都能用同一個 signal 存取邊界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P2-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define signal JSON schema\",\n      \"phase\": \"Phase 2\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P1-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/research/schema.json\",\n        \"services/research/signal_example.json\",\n        \"services/research/signal_schema_v1.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"payload keys documented\",\n        \"worker contract references same schema\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Canonical machine schema approved. Final contract alignment is tracked in P2-002 so schema.json, examples, and human-facing docs describe the same execution semantics.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T14:12:24Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 signal 的機器可讀 schema，鎖定欄位、型別與交易語義，避免研究端和執行端各說各話。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P2-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Sync schema docs and examples to schema.json v1\",\n      \"phase\": \"Phase 2\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P2-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/research/signal_schema_v1.md\",\n        \"services/research/example_payload.json\",\n        \"services/research/signal_example.json\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"schema docs use the same field names and action vocabulary as schema.json\",\n        \"EXIT plus direction semantics are documented for execution consumers\",\n        \"examples match the locked execution schema\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Human-facing schema docs, machine schema, and both example payload sets are aligned and validated against schema.json v1.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T15:09:46Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把 schema 文件、範例 payload 與 machine schema 對齊成同一套契約，讓人看的文件和程式吃的格式一致。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P3-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Wire LEAN runtime signal consumer\",\n      \"phase\": \"Phase 3\",\n      \"owner\": \"Claude\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"review\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P1-001\",\n        \"P2-002\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/execution/lean-runtime/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"runtime can consume signal payload\",\n        \"broker config edge documented\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Signal consumer artifacts complete: signal_consumer.py, executor.py, symbol_parser.py. Dead-code bug fixed (minor version warning). Review focus: (1) symbol_parser _resolve_symbol uses duck-typed algo.Symbol() — real LEAN integration needs Symbol.Create(ticker, SecurityType, Market); (2) SELL+LONG dispatch always uses Liquidate regardless of quantity_type (docstring says SetHoldings for PERCENT_PORTFOLIO — functionally equivalent but inconsistent); (3) EXIT+SHORT uses holdings quantity for close — verify broker round-trip.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T03:36:14Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把 signal intake 真正接進 LEAN runtime，讓已經標準化的訊號可以被解析、檢查後送到執行流程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P4-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Draft control-plane routing contract\",\n      \"phase\": \"Phase 4\",\n      \"owner\": \"Claude\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Codex\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P2-002\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/control-plane/router/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"router contract documented\",\n        \"monitoring handoff documented\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Review approved: router contract is locked for v1. Remaining items are follow-up infrastructure tasks, not blockers for the contract.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T03:43:02Z\",\n      \"review_notes_zh\": [\n        \"審查通過：permission evaluation 已前移，deny-first evaluator 與最小 role resolution 已和 contract 對齊。\",\n        \"session TTL / rate-limit 現在是鎖定政策，runtime enforcement 明確 deferred 到 gateway 或 session backend，這對 v1 contract 是可接受的。\",\n        \"monitoring 與 SSE 已改成 deferred scope，不再混成 v1 已實作能力。\"\n      ],\n      \"review_file\": \"services/control-plane/router/review_p4001_codex_zh.md\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 control-plane router 的邊界，決定請求怎麼分類、怎麼檢查權限、怎麼把狀態與監控交給下游。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OPS-010\",\n      \"title\": \"Validate status command flow\",\n      \"phase\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"artifacts\": [],\n      \"acceptance\": [],\n      \"next\": \"Validated assign/start/progress/blocker/handoff/done flow end-to-end\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T04:30:43Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"驗證狀態指令流程可用，確認 assign、start、progress、handoff、blocker、done 會正確更新資料。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OPS-011\",\n      \"title\": \"Align agent handoff briefs with canonical collaboration flow\",\n      \"phase\": \"Foundation\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"artifacts\": [],\n      \"acceptance\": [],\n      \"next\": \"Updated collaboration guidance so every LLM now works in this order: finish assigned reviews first, then own unblocked work, then claim other safe tasks and hand them back to the original owner for review.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T00:58:18Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把三個 agent 的 brief 統一到同一套協作流程，避免不同 prompt 指向不同規則。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ARC-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Publish target architecture aligned to OpenClaw evolution model\",\n      \"phase\": \"Architecture\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"TARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"responsibility split documented\",\n        \"promotion gate defined\",\n        \"learning object split documented\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Use the target architecture as the north star for product planning\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T16:25:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把新版目標架構寫清楚，讓 OpenClaw、Evolution Plane、Research Plane 與 LEAN 的責任分工有共同北極星。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ARC-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Publish epic roadmap aligned to target architecture\",\n      \"phase\": \"Architecture\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"ARC-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"ROADMAP.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"epics sequenced\",\n        \"ownership proposed\",\n        \"immediate next moves listed\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Published epic roadmap that turns the target architecture into sequenced delivery slices and ownership lanes\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-01T06:26:52Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把目標架構拆成可落地的 Epic 與任務序列，讓後續可以照依賴順序逐步實作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"EX-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define artifact loader contract for paper and live execution\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic A\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P2-001\",\n        \"P3-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/execution/artifact-loader/contract.md\",\n        \"services/execution/artifact-loader/artifact_metadata_schema.json\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"paper and live loader behavior documented\",\n        \"artifact metadata contract defined\",\n        \"promotion state checks specified\",\n        \"[CODEX NOTE] artifact loader must use LEAN Object Store (ObjectStore.Save/Read) as the transport between registry and LEAN runtime — direct file injection or GCS reads bypassing LEAN data provider are not acceptable\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Resetting status per AUD-CLAUDE-001: contract is done but implementation is missing. Re-evaluating LEAN native bridge.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T18:00:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 artifact loader 契約，確保 LEAN 只會透過受治理的 artifact 與 Object Store 載入 paper/live 可執行內容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OC-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define OpenClaw tool permission model with allowlist and denylist\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic B\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"P4-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/control-plane/permissions/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"tool policy model defined\",\n        \"persona-scoped allowlist and denylist documented\",\n        \"approval hooks identified\",\n        \"[CODEX NOTE] any tool that calls LEAN directly must be restricted to paper/backtest context only in the permission model — live execution must always flow through REG → SIG → L, never through a direct O → L tool call\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"OC-001 APPROVED for v1 lock. Review written at services/control-plane/permissions/review_oc001_claude.md. Key: deny-first model + 6 mandatory deny rules + approval hooks all aligned with router v1. Two minor open items (allow_with_approval not in schema effect enum; promotion-state not checked at router layer) documented but do not block v1.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T04:20:37Z\",\n      \"review_notes_zh\": [\n        \"審查通過：deny-first 模型、強制 deny 規則與 approval hook 都已和 Router v1 對齊。\",\n        \"後續只需追蹤兩個 minor open items：policy schema 是否要直接表達 allow_with_approval，以及 promotion-state 是否要在 router 層做二次確認。\"\n      ],\n      \"review_file\": \"services/control-plane/permissions/review_oc001_claude.md\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"定義 OpenClaw 的工具權限模型，用 allowlist/denylist 把哪些 persona、channel、cron 能做哪些事鎖清楚。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OC-002\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement OpenClaw cron workflows for ingest, review, retrain, and deploy\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic B\",\n      \"owner\": \"Gemini\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"stat