04\",\n        \"WORK_REBASELINE.md\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"audits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"all assigned tasks inspected\",\n        \"upstream integration gaps identified\",\n        \"status and roadmap correction recommendations provided\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Audit complete. Handed off to Codex.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T16:00:00Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"根據新的上游 OSS 整合模型審計 Gemini 負責的任務，識別實作缺口。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"REG-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Add rollback and lineage requirements to promoted artifacts\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic C\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"review\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"REG-001\",\n        \"REG-002\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/registry/lineage/contract.md\",\n        \"services/registry/lineage/promoted_artifact_metadata.schema.json\",\n        \"artifact_metadata_schema.json\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"rollback metadata required\",\n        \"lineage chain documented\",\n        \"promotion audit references rollback target\"\n      ],\n      \"next\": \"Drafted REG-003 promoted artifact lineage contract, canonical schema, and compatibility alias at artifact_metadata_schema.json. Please review rollback strictness, loader-side sufficiency, and experiment-backend compatibility.\",\n      \"last_update\": \"2026-04-02T13:50:25Z\",\n      \"summary_zh\": \"把 rollback 與 lineage 要求補進所有已升版 artifact，確保 live 出問題時能追來源並安全回退。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"FB-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Define trajectory and preference store schema\",\n      \"phase\": \"Epic D\",\n      \"owner\": \"Codex\",\n      \"reviewer\": \"Claude\",\n      \"status\": \"review\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"REG-001\"\n      ],\n      \"artifacts\": [\n        \"services/feedback/schema/\"\n      ],\n      \"acceptance\": [\n        \"tra