/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:132:- Currently there is no adapter that takes upstream OpenClaw strategy/workflow outputs and converts them to local StrategySpec objects.\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:133:- There is no documented field mapping from upstream OpenClaw → `strategy_spec.schema.json`.\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:136:1. Select upstream OpenClaw source (same dependency as OC-001).\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:137:2. Inspect upstream OpenClaw's workflow output format (what does it produce after an orchestration run?).\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:138:3. Write an adapter: upstream OpenClaw output → local StrategySpec, documenting field-by-field mapping.\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:151:| 3 | Select and pin upstream OpenClaw source | Upstream selection | OC-001, OC-002, OC-003 adapter work |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:152:| 4 | OC-001: Write adapter from upstream OpenClaw permissions → local deny-first model (or formally document local-surrogate designation) | Adapter task | OC-001 final lock |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:153:| 5 | OC-003: Write adapter from upstream OpenClaw outputs → local StrategySpec (or document extension fields) | Adapter task | RS-002, OC-003 final lock |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:154:| 6 | P4-001: Decide persona agent fate — upstream OpenClaw runtime integration vs. permanent local surrogate — and document decision in contract.md | Decision / doc task | LP-001, OC-002 |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:164:| OC-001 | `done` | Valid as local contract; add note: \"upstream OpenClaw integration pending OpenClaw source selection\" |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:165:| OC-003 | `done` | Valid as local contract; add note: \"upstream adapter pending OpenClaw source selection\" |\naudits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md:166:| P4-001 | `done` | Valid as local contract; add note: \"persona agent is local stub — upstream OpenClaw integration decision deferred\" |\naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:8:本次審計確認 Gemini 負責的任務中，本地基礎建設（Foundation）與合約工作（Contract）路徑清晰，但涉及外部 OSS 整合（OpenClaw, MLflow, TRL, Ray）的部分普遍存在「只有規格、沒有實作整合」的問題。所有 Epic B/E/F 的任務都必須補齊版本釘選與適配器邊界。\naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:19:- **`OC-002` (OpenClaw Cron)**: \naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:20:    - **問題**: 目前僅有「定義」任務，未指定如何接合上游 `OpenClaw` 的 Workflow Entrypoints。\naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:35:| `OC-002` | OpenClaw | Upstream repo ref, version pin, workflow entrypoint mapping |\naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:47:2. **`OC-002`**: 更新驗收準則，必須包含對上游 OpenClaw 的配置實作。\naudits/oss-alignment/gemini_audit.md:49:4. **建立新 Spike**: 針對 `OpenClaw` 上游 Repo 的整合方式進行評估。\nworkflows.py:2:OC-002: OpenClaw Workflow Adapter.\nworkflows.py:7:class OpenClawWorkflowAdapter:\nworkflows.py:9:        # Pinning upstream OpenClaw version/ref\nworkflows.py:10:        self.upstream_ref = \"github.com/openclaw/openclaw-core\"\nworkflows.py:15:        Maps raw research source to OpenClaw's ingestion workflow parameters.\nworkflows.py:32:        Maps a registry artifact to an OpenClaw deployment workflow.\n.github/workflows/gcp-deploy.yml:28:        docker build -t asia-east1-docker.pkg.dev/${{ secrets.GCP_PROJECT_ID }}/openclaw/lean-engine:${{ github.sha }} .\n.github/workflows/gcp-deploy.yml:32:        docker push asia-east1-docker.pkg.dev/${{ secrets.GCP_PROJECT_ID }}/openclaw/lean-engine:${{ github.sha }}\ndocker-compose.yml:4:# OpenClaw + LEAN docker-compose\ndocker-compose.yml:10:#   control-plane-persona → Persona agent stub; will integrate upstream OpenClaw\ndocker-compose.yml:20:# Future: when openclaw repo is extracted, `lean:` will build from\nscripts/ai_status.py:58:        \"project\": \"openclaw-lean\",\nscripts/ai_status.py:61:            \"Stabilize the OpenClaw / LEAN collaboration operating system so Claude, Gemini, \"\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:1:# OpenClaw Target Architecture\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:4:Status: target-state architecture for the governed OpenClaw evolution platform\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:8:OpenClaw should orchestrate workflows.\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:23:### OpenClaw\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:25:OpenClaw is the process and governance layer.\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:36:OpenClaw is not the learning framework and is not the execution engine.\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:84:1. OpenClaw cron or approved tool workflows ingest papers, repos, and notes.\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:213:- OpenClaw services on GCP managed services or containers\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:247:- upstream OpenClaw integration\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:254:- `OpenClaw`\nTARGET_ARCHITECTURE.md:278:OpenClaw may discover, critique, optimize, and recommend.\n.claude/settings.json:6:      \"Bash(AI_NAME=Claude python3 scripts/ai_status.py progress ARC-007 \\\"Preparatory migration work complete in current repo. OSS adapter split done, docker-compose updated, LEAN bridge created, guide updated. Human operator must complete: \\\\(1\\\\) create openclaw repo, \\\\(2\\\\) create openclaw-lean fork, \\\\(3\\\\) git mv services/ scripts/ audits/ docs to openclaw, \\\\(4\\\\) git submodule add openclaw-lean as lean/.\\\")\"\n.claude/settings.local.json:12:      \"Bash(AI_NAME=Claude bash scripts/ai-status.sh progress AUD-CLAUDE-001 \\\"Audit complete. Key findings: \\\\(1\\\\) EX-001 OVERSTATED — marked done but services/execution/artifact-loader/ does not exist; must be reset to in_progress/blocked. \\\\(2\\\\) P3-001 valid design but not LEAN-integrated: no LEAN dep pinned, _resolve_symbol\\\\(\\\\) uses invalid LEAN API, no smoke test. \\\\(3\\\\) P4-001 valid local contract; persona agent is an all-stub surrogate — upstream OpenClaw integration decision pending. \\\\(4\\\\) OC-001 and OC-003 valid as local contracts but no upstream OpenClaw adapter exists — integration blocked until OpenClaw source is selected.\\\")\",\n.claude/settings.local.json:13:      \"Bash(AI_NAME=Claude python3 scripts/ai_status.py progress AUD-CLAUDE-001 \\\"Audit complete. Key findings: \\\\(1\\\\) EX-001 OVERSTATED — marked done but services/execution/artifact-loader/ does not exist; must be reset to in_progress/blocked. \\\\(2\\\\) P3-001 valid design but not LEAN-integrated: no LEAN dep pinned, _resolve_symbol\\\\(\\\\) uses invalid LEAN API, no smoke test. \\\\(3\\\\) P4-001 valid local contract; persona agent is all-stub surrogate — upstream OpenClaw integration decision pending. \\\\(4\\\\) OC-001 and OC-003 valid as local contracts but no upstream OpenClaw adapter exists — blocked on OpenClaw source selection.\\\")\",\n.claude/settings.local.json:18:      \"Bash(AI_NAME=Claude python3 scripts/ai_status.py progress AUD-CLAUDE-001 \\\"Audit complete. Key findings: \\\\(1\\\\) EX-001 OVERSTATED — marked done but services/execution/artifact-loader/ does not exist in repo; must be reset. \\\\(2\\\\) P3-001 valid adapter design but not LEAN-integrated: no LEAN dep pinned, _resolve_symbol\\\\(\\\\) uses invalid duck-typed API instead of Symbol.Create\\\\(\\\\), no smoke test. \\\\(3\\\\) P4-001 valid local contract; persona agent is all-stub surrogate — upstream OpenClaw integration decision deferred. \\\\(4\\\\) OC-001 and OC-003 valid as local contracts but no upstream OpenClaw adapter exists — blocked on OpenClaw source selection. Full findings at audits/oss-alignment/claude_audit.md.\\\")\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:175:      \"next\": \"Defining workflow entrypoints and mapping StrategySpec to OpenClaw workflow parameters.\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:301:      \"next\": \"Define governed ingestion so OpenClaw can discover research without free-roaming live changes\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:409:        \"tools/openclaw-local/README.md\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:410:        \"tools/openclaw-local/watcher/watch_review.py\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:411:        \"tools/openclaw-local/windows/OpenClawAgent.ps1\",\n.orchestrator/state.json:412:        \"tools/openclaw-local/windows/profiles.example.json\",\n.orchestrator/state.jso